<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Tiago</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tiago</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tiago</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Surat husi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tiago</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s">Tiago hahuu nia surat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Surat nee husi hau, Tiago.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mateus 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Marcos 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:19">Galásia 1:19</ref></char></note> Hau Maromak nia atan ho Nai Jesus Kristu nia atan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Hau hakerek surat nee ba maluk Judeu sira nebee namkari hela iha nasaun sel-seluk. Kumprimentus ba imi hotu.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamriik metin iha tentasaun laran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Maun-alin sira, bainhira imi hasoru tentasaun oi-oin, haksolok deit ba. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Tanba imi hatene katak, se ita liu tentasaun nebee koko ita nia fiar mak ita aprende atu aguenta nafatin. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Imi tenki aguenta nafatin too imi sai ema nebee moris loos, kompletu, i la falta buat ida.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Maibee se iha imi ruma falta matenek hodi hatene Maromak nia hakarak, entaun husu ba Maromak mak Nia sei foo. Tanba Nia foo ba ema hotu-hotu ho laran luak, i Nia la litik ita bainhira ita husu. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Maibee bainhira imi husu, imi tenki husu ho laran metin, la bele laran ru-rua. Tanba see mak laran ru-rua, nia hanesan laloran nebee baku ba-mai iha anin boot. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Ema hanesan nee lalika mehi atu simu buat ruma husi Nai Maromak. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Ema nee ohin hanoin ida, aban hanoin seluk fali. Saida mak nia halo, nia namlele hela deit.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema kiak ho ema riku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Ema sarani nebee kiak, tenki haksolok, tanba Maromak hasae tiha nia ba iha fatin aas. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />I ema sarani nebee riku, tenki haksolok bainhira Maromak hatuun nia. Tanba ema riku sei la dura, hanesan ai funan fuik nebee la kleur namlaik ona. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ai funan bele kapaas, maibee bainhira loro matan sae, nia manas halo ai nee namlaik tiha i nia funan monu, nunee nia furak lakon tiha. Ema riku mos sei sai hanesan nee. Iha tempu nebee nia sei fadigadu hela ho nia negosiu, nia namlaik monu tiha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-7">Isaias 40:6-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tentasaun nunka mai husi Nai Maromak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Maromak foo bensaun ba ema nebee aguenta ho pasiensia kuandu hasoru tentasaun oi-oin nebee koko nia fiar. Bainhira nia manaan, Maromak sei foo premiu ba nia. Premiu nee mak moris nebee Maromak promete ona atu foo ba ema nebee hadomi Nia.<verse eid="JAS 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Se iha buat ruma mak dada imi atu halo sala, imi la bele dehan, “Ida nee mai husi Maromak.” Tanba la iha buat ida mak bele dada Maromak atu halo sala, i Maromak mos nunka dada ema ida atu monu ba sala. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Maibee hakarak aat nebee iha ita nia laran mak provoka ita hodi rasta ita monu ba lasu. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Se ita halo tuir hakarak aat nebee mak iha ita nia laran nee, ita halo sala. I se sala nee buras iha ita nia aan, too ikus sala nee lori ita ba mate.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Maun-alin doben sira, bainhira ema bosok imi kona ba buat sira nee, keta fiar! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Prezenti diak ho furak hotu-hotu nebee ita simu, mai husi Aman Maromak. Nia mak halo loro matan, fulan ho fitun sira. Buat sira nee muda beibeik, maibee Maromak nunka muda. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Maromak desidi atu foo moris mai ita liu husi Nia liafuan, Nia liafuan nee loos. Nunee, husi buat hotu-hotu nebee Nia halo iha lalehan ho rai, Nia konsidera liu ita, hanesan batar fulin diak nian nebee toos nain taa uluk hodi oferese ba Maromak.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rona Nai Maromak nia liafuan hodi halo tuir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Maun-alin doben sira, hanoin di-diak! Imi tenki prontu hodi rona, keta ansi koalia, i keta hirus lalais. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Tanba ita ema nia hirus la lori ita atu moris loos tuir Maromak nia hakarak. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nee duni imi tenki soe tiha imi nia hahalok foer ho hahalok aat sira hotu. Haraik aan hodi simu liafuan nebee Maromak kuda iha imi nia laran, liafuan nee mak bele salva imi.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Maromak nia liafuan nee, imi tenki halo tuir, la bele rona deit! Se lae, imi bosok imi nia aan rasik. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Kuandu ema rona ona liafuan nee, maibee la halo tuir, nee hanesan nia fihir nia aan iha lalenok. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Haree hotu tiha, nia fila kotuk haluha kedas nia oin halo nusaa. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Maromak nia lei nee diak teb-tebes i bele foo liberdade mai ita. Nunee imi tenki foo atensaun di-diak ba lei nee. Keta haluha fali buat nebee imi rona tiha ona, maibee hanoin beibeik hodi halo tuir. Se imi halo hanesan nee, imi hetan bensaun husi Maromak iha buat hotu-hotu nebee imi halo.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Se ema ruma hanoin nia badinas tuir relijiaun, maibee la sukat di-diak nia ibun, nia bosok nia aan rasik. Relijiaun hanesan nee saugati deit. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Relijiaun nebee ita nia Aman Maromak konsidera loos ho moos mak nee: Ita tenki tau matan ba oan kiak sira ho feto faluk sira nebee iha susar nia laran, i tenki kuidadu ita nia aan atu la bele tuir hahalok aat mundu nian.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">La bele fihir ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Maun-alin sira, ita nia Nai Jesus Kristu nee Kbiit Nain. Nudar ema nebee fiar ba Nia, imi la bele fihir ema. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Ezemplu, iha ema nain rua baa tuir imi nia enkontru. Ida riku hatais ropa folin karun ho kadeli osan mean iha nia liman, ida kiak hatais hena bosan nebee naklees. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />I imi simu kedas ema riku nee ho respeitu hodi dehan, “Senhor, favor mai tuur iha oin.” Maibee ba ida kiak nee, imi dehan, “O hamriik iha kotuk nebaa”, se lae, “Tuur deit iha rai.” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Se imi halo nunee, imi foti imi nia aan hanesan fali juis nebee laran aat hodi konsidera imi nia maluk sarani balu liu fali sira seluk.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Maun-alin doben sira, rona mai. Maromak hili ona ema kiak iha mundu nee atu riku iha fiar hodi tama iha Nia reinu, hanesan Nia promete tiha ona ba ema nebee hadomi Nia. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Maibee imi hatuun fali ema kiak. Afinal imi hatene katak ema riku mak hanehan imi hodi obriga imi baa hataan iha tribunal. <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Sira mak hatete aat ita nia Nai nia naran nebee boot teb-tebes.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Iha Livru Sagradu ita nia Liurai foo ukun fuan ida nebee dehan, “O tenki hadomi o nia maluk hanesan o hadomi o nia aan rasik.” Se imi halo tuir ukun fuan nee, imi halo buat nebee loos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levítiku 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Maibee se imi haree ema balu diak i la konsidera ema seluk, imi halo sala, i hatudu katak imi ema nebee kontra Maromak nia ukun fuan. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Se ema ruma halo tuir ukun fuan tomak maibee nia kontra fali ukun fuan ida deit mos, nia kontra tiha ona ukun fuan hotu kedas. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ezemplu, Maromak foo ona ukun fuan ida nunee: “La bele halo sala ho ema nia feen ka laen.” Nia mos foo ukun fuan seluk dehan, “La bele oho ema.” Nunee, se imi la halo sala ho ema nia kaben, maibee imi oho ema, imi sai ona ema nebee kontra Maromak nia ukun fuan tomak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Ézodu 20:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14">14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Deuteronómiu 5:17</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18">18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Aban-bainrua Maromak sei foo justisa tuir ukun fuan nebee mak halo ita sai livre. Nee duni, imi nia liafuan ho imi nia hahalok tenki haan malu ho ukun fuan nee. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Tanba ema nebee mak la hatudu laran luak ba nia maluk sira, aban-bainrua Maromak tesi ema hotu nia lia, Nia mos la hatudu laran luak ba ema nee. Maibee see mak hatudu laran luak ba nia maluk, Maromak mos hatudu laran luak ba nia.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fiar ba Nai Jesus maibee la hatudu hahalok diak, la iha folin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Maun-alin sira, se ema ruma dehan nia fiar ba Jesus Kristu maibee nia hahalok diak la iha, fiar hanesan nee iha folin saida? Fiar nee bele salva nia ka lae? La bele! <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Hanoin took, se karik iha maluk sarani ruma presiza hena ka hahaan, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />maibee imi la foo, i imi dehan deit, “Fila ho laran hakmatek. Hatais faru manas ba, i haan halo bosu ba!” Liafuan nee la iha folin buat ida. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Nunee mos ita nia fiar, se ita la hatudu liu husi hahalok, fiar nee buat maten ida.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Karik ema ruma dehan, “Iha ema balu fiar deit, i balu hatudu hahalok diak.” Hau hataan, “Se o la hatudu hahalok diak, oinsaa mak hau bele haree katak o fiar ba Kristu? Maibee o bele haree katak hau fiar, liu husi hau nia hahalok.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />O fiar Maromak mesak ida deit, la iha tan seluk. Nee loos! Maibee diabu sira mos fiar nunee, nee mak diabu sira nee nakdedar ho tauk.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Beik-teen! Imi hakarak hau esplika saida tan para imi bele kompriende katak, fiar ba Maromak maibee la hatudu liu husi hahalok, saugati deit? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Hanoin took ita nia bei-ala Abraão. Nia halo tuir Maromak nia orden hodi tau nia oan Isac ba iha meza sakrifisiu atu oferese ba Maromak. Tanba nee mak Maromak simu Abraão hodi konsidera nia ema ida nebee moris loos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Jénesis 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Nunee ita haree katak Abraão nia fiar ho nia hahalok lao hamutuk. Nia hahalok halo nia fiar sai kompletu. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Nee tuir lo-loos buat nebee hakerek iha Livru Sagradu dehan, “Abraão fiar ba Maromak, nee mak Maromak hamoos nia sala hodi simu nia.” I Maromak bolu nia dehan, “belun.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Jénesis 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Krónikas 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isaias 41:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Agora imi hatene ona katak, ita fiar deit la too, ita tenki hatudu hahalok diak foin Maromak simu ita.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Haree ezemplu ida tan husi Rahab, feto luroon ida. Bainhira espiaun Israel sira baa iha Rahab nia rain, nia subar sira iha uma, depois haruka sira halai sai liu husi dalan seluk, para ema la bele oho. Tanba Rahab nia hahalok diak nee mak Maromak simu nia hodi konsidera nia ema ida nebee moris loos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Josué 2:1-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Isin lolon nebee la iha iis, mate. Nunee mos fiar nebee la hatudu ho hahalok diak, nee hanesan buat maten ida.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuidadu di-diak o nia ibun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Maun-alin sira, diak liu imi balu deit mak sai mestri hodi hanorin sarani sira, la bele barak. Tanba imi hatene katak, ita nebee hanorin sarani sira, Maromak sei foo justisa todan liu ba ita duke ba ema seluk. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ita hotu halo sala oi-oin. Se iha ema ruma nebee nunka koalia sala karik, ema nee moris loos i nia konsege domina nia aan tomak. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Ita bele foti ezemplu husi kuda. Ita kesi tali iha kuda nia ibun para ita bele domina kuda nee. Nunee kuda lao ba-mai tuir ita nia hakarak. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Ezemplu ida tan mak roo. Maski roo boot, i anin nebee dudu roo nee mos makaas, maibee kapitaun roo bele dulas kamudi kiikoan hodi halo roo boot nee fila ba fila mai tuir nia hakarak. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Nunee mos ita nia ibun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha versikulu 5-10, Tiago temi “nanaal” hodi hatudu ba ema nia koalia. Iha lian Tetun, ita dehan “ibun”. Por ezemplu, ita dehan “ibun boot”, laos “nanaal boot”.</char></note> Maski ita nia ibun nee parte kiikoan iha ita nia isin lolon, maibee ita uza hodi foti aan kona ba buat boot. Hanoin took. Ahi kiikoan ida bele sunu mutuk ai laran boot ida. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Ita nia ibun mos hanesan ahi. Iha ita nia isin lolon nee, ita nia ibun nakonu ho buat aat nebee estraga ita nia aan tomak. Nee hanesan ita nia ibun lori ahi infernu nian hodi sunu ita nia moris tomak.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ita ema bele hamaus animal fuik oi-oin, manu fuik, animal nebee dolar iha rai, ho ikan iha tasi. Animal sira nee hotu ita domina tiha ona para halo tuir ita nia hakarak. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Maibee la iha ema ida mak bele domina nia ibun para halo tuir nia hakarak. Tanba ita nia ibun fuik ho aat, nakonu ho veneno nebee halo mate ema.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ita uza ita nia ibun hodi hahii Nai Maromak ita nia Aman. Ita mos uza ita nia ibun nee hodi foo malisan ba ema seluk, afinal ema nee mos Maromak halo hanesan Nia Aan. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Nunee ita uza ita nia ibun hodi hahii Maromak ho mos foo malisan ba ema seluk. Maun-alin sira, la bele nunee!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Jénesis 1:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Bee moos ho bee meer la bele sai husi bee matan ida deit. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Maun-alin sira, ai figeira bele foo fuan oliveira ka? Ai uvas bele foo fuan figeira ka? La iha. Nunee mos bee matan ida nebee meer la bele foo fali bee moos.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matenek lo-loos mai husi Nai Maromak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Iha ema ruma husi imi matenek hodi kompriende Maromak nia dalan ka? Se nunee nia tenki moris loos i halo buat diak ho haraik aan hodi hatudu katak matenek nee mai husi Maromak. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Maibee se o laran moras hela deit ema seluk i hakarak manaan mesak deit, entaun la bele bosok ema hodi gaba aan dehan o nee ema matenek. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Matenek hanesan nee laos mai husi lalehan maibee mai husi mundu. Matenek nee laos tuir Maromak nia Espiritu, maibee tuir fali diabu. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Se o laran moras hela deit ema seluk i hakarak manaan mesak deit, o sei halo rungu-ranga ho hahalok aat oi-oin deit.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Maibee matenek nebee mai husi Maromak mak nee: Primeiru tenki moos, depois halo ita gosta dame, konsidera ema seluk, rona ema seluk, laran luak, gosta ajuda ema, la haree ba ema boot ka kiik, i halo ho laran. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Bainhira dame nain sira lori dame, too ikus ema mos halo buat diak ba malu, hanesan mos toos nain kuda fini, too nia tempu nia hetan rezultadu barak.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Hakruuk ba Nai Maromak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Tanba saida mak imi istori malu beibeik, too baku malu? Tanba imi kaan buat oi-oin deit, halo imi nia laran la hakmatek. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Imi kaan atu hetan buat ruma, maibee la hetan, nunee imi atu oho malu tan. Imi hakarak teb-tebes atu hetan sasaan hanesan imi nia maluk nian, maibee imi la hetan, nunee imi istori malu i baku malu. Imi la hetan tanba imi la husu ba Maromak. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Imi husu ba Maromak mos, imi la hetan nafatin, tanba imi husu ho objetivu nebee la loos. Imi hakarak hetan para imi goza deit.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Imi nia laran la foo ba Maromak, hanesan feen nebee gosta fali mane seluk. Imi hatene katak see mak hadomi liu buat mundu nian, nia kontra Maromak. See mak hakarak halo belun ho buat aat iha mundu nee, nia sai Maromak nia inimigu. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Iha Livru Sagradu hatete, “Maromak tau tiha ona Nia Espiritu iha ita nia laran. Nia Espiritu nee hakarak atu ita foo laran ba Maromak mesak deit, se lae Nia lakohi simu.” Keta hanoin katak liafuan nee mamuk. <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Maski nunee Maromak hatudu liu tan Nia laran diak ba ita. Nee hanesan hakerek iha Livru Sagradu dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">“Maromak kontra ema nebee mak foti aan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">maibee Nia hatudu Nia laran diak ba ema nebee mak haraik aan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Provérbiu 3:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nee duni hakruuk ba Maromak. Tuba rai metin hodi hasoru Satanás mak Satanás sei halai sees husi imi. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Hakbesik aan ba Maromak mak Maromak mos hakbesik Aan ba imi. Imi nebee moris iha sala nia laran, hamoos imi nia aan ba. I imi nebee laran ru-rua, foo imi nia laran tomak ba Maromak. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Diak liu imi laran tristi hodi tanis halerik tanba imi nia sala. Lalika hamnasa tan, maibee tanis ba! Lalika kontenti tan, maibee tristi ba. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Imi tenki haraik aan iha ita nia Nai nia oin mak Nia sei foti sae imi.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">La bele hatete aat ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Maun-alin sira, la bele hatete aat imi nia maluk sarani. Se o hatete aat o nia maluk hodi foo sala ba nia, entaun o hatete aat Maromak nia lei hodi dehan lei nee la diak. Se o foo sala ba Maromak nia lei nunee, entaun o laos ona ema nebee tuir Nia lei, maibee o foti aan hanesan fali juis nebee desidi lei nee vale ka la vale. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Maromak mak halo lei, i Nia deit mak iha direitu atu tesi ema nia lia. So Nia deit mak bele salva ema ka foo kastigu ba ema. O nee see fali mak o mos foo sala ba o nia maluk?!<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">La bele gaba aan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Iha kontratu nain balu dehan, “Ohin ka aban ami sei baa iha sidade ida nee ka sidade ida nebaa. Ami sei hela iha nebaa tinan ida hodi kontratu manaan osan barak.” Imi nebee foti aan hanesan nee, rona mai! <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Imi la hatene loron aban nee saida mak sei mosu. Ita ema nia moris hanesan abu-abu nebee ema haree lalais deit, depois lakon tiha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Provérbiu 27:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Tuir loos imi tenki dehan, “Se Nai Maromak hakarak, ami sei moris hodi halo ida nee ka ida nebaa.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Maibee imi gaba aan hodi hanoin katak planu hotu-hotu iha imi nia liman laran. Foti aan hanesan nee sala boot.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Hanoin di-diak! Se ita hatene buat diak nebee ita tenki halo, maibee ita la halo, nee sala ona.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Nai Maromak sei kastigu ema riku nebee hanehan ema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Imi ema riku sira, rona mai! Tanis halerik ona ba, tanba terus ho susar atu kona ona imi. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Imi nia riku-soin nabeen hotu ona. Imi nia hena diak sira mos, barata haan halo kuak tiha ona. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Imi nia osan mean ho osan mutin aat tiha ona. Aban-bainrua osan nebee aat ona nee sei sai hanesan sasin hodi hatudu imi nia sala, i sai hanesan ahi hodi haan mutuk tiha imi nia isin. Maski mundu atu besik remata ona, maibee imi sei rai nafatin riku-soin barak ba imi nia aan. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ema nebee servisu mate aan ba imi iha imi nia toos, imi la selu. Agora sira halerik tanba kole saugati deit, i sira nia halerik too tiha ona iha Nai Maromak Kbiit Nain nia tilun.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Deuteronómiu 24:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Iha mundu nee imi moris patarata hodi goza tuun-sae. Imi halo bokur imi nia aan hanesan karau nebee ema hakiak halo bokur di-diak para oho. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ema nebee la iha sala, imi hamonu kastigu hodi oho sira, i sira la iha kbiit atu kontra imi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:19">Mateus 6:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasiensia iha terus nia laran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nee duni maun-alin sira, imi tenki pasiensia hodi hein Nai Jesus fila fali mai husi lalehan. Haree ba toos nain sira, sira pasiensia hodi hein too udan monu rai foin bele kuda fini. Depois hein tan udan atu rega toos para batar foo isin. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Imi mos tenki pasiensia nunee, i laran metin nafatin, tanba Nai Jesus besik fila ona.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Maun-alin sira, keta murmura ba malu, se lae Maromak sei kastigu imi. Haree ba, Juis Boot hamriik ona iha odamatan oin!<verse eid="JAS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Maun-alin sira, profeta sira nebee koalia hodi Nai Maromak nia naran, foo ezemplu diak mai ita atu halo tuir. Maski sira hetan terus oi-oin, maibee sira pasiensia nafatin. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Keta haluha ema sira nebee aguenta nafatin iha terus laran, ita rekonhese katak sira nee ema nebee hetan bensaun. Ida mak Jó. Imi hatene oinsaa mak nia aguenta iha susar laran, too ikus Nai Maromak foo bensaun ba nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21-22">Job 1:21-22</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Salmu 103:8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:2-3">Tiago 1:2-3</ref>,<ref loc="JAS 1:12">12</ref></char></note> Tanba Nai Maromak laran luak teb-tebes i sempre hanoin ema nebee terus.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">La bele jura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Maun-alin sira, rona di-diak mai. La bele jura! Atu jura temi lalehan, ka jura temi rai ka buat sel-seluk tan mos, la bele. Se buat ruma loos, dehan deit “Loos.” Se lae, dehan deit “Lae”, para Maromak keta kastigu imi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mateus 5:34-37</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Orasaun nebee iha kbiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Se imi sira nee ida hetan terus ho susar, nia tenki harohan ba Maromak. Se imi ida haksolok, nia tenki hananu hahii Maromak. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Se iha ema ruma moras, nia tenki haruka bolu responsavel sarani sira nian atu sira mai harohan ba nia, i kose mina ba nia hodi Nai Jesus nia naran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Marcos 6:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Se sira halo orasaun ho fiar, sira nia orasaun sei halo ema moras nee diak fali. Ita nia Nai sei kura nia, i se ema nee halo sala ruma, Maromak sei hamoos tiha nia sala nee. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nee duni imi tenki foo sai imi nia sala ba malu i halo orasaun ba malu, atu nunee imi bele hetan kura. Ema nebee moris loos, sira nia orasaun iha forsa teb-tebes hodi halo buat barak. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Ezemplu ida mak profeta Elias. Nia ema hanesan mos ita, maibee bainhira nia harohan ho laran tomak para udan la bele monu iha rai Israel, udan la mai duni durante tinan tolu ho balu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Liurai 17:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Depois nia harohan atu udan bele tuun fali mak udan tuun husi lalehan. Nunee ema nia toos foo fali rezultadu diak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">1 Liurai 18:42-45</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Maun-alin sira, se imi ida lao sees husi dalan loos, depois ema ruma lori nia fila fali ba Maromak, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />hanoin di-diak. See mak halo ema sala nain ida fila kotuk ba nia sala, nia salva ona ema nee husi mate tinan ba tinan. I sala barak nebee ema nee halo tiha ona, Maromak sei hamoos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Provérbiu 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1 Pedro 4:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>